Keep this license, copyright notices and applicable attribution notices with redistributed Covered Materials. Clearly identify modifications and preserve third-party notices. Distribute Covered Materials and modifications under these same terms, without removing eligibility restrictions or implying endorsement. Every recipient receives its grant directly from Licensor and must qualify independently. Separately authored, separable components may have their own terms. Distribution must not impose terms that prevent recipients from exercising this license's permissions for the Covered Materials.
You may charge for permitted distribution, installation or services when the relevant use qualifies under section 3. Providing hosted or interactive access is use of the software; both the provider and any commercial beneficiary on whose behalf it is operated must qualify or obtain a separate license. Ordinary output sharing alone is not redistribution of the software.

